<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#16263F',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 3, marginBottom: 14 }}>TOKEN ECONOMICS</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, marginBottom: 22 }}>
        Token：AI 世界的<br />计费货币，中文更贵
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#FF9F1C', marginBottom: 22 }} />
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 68, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>40%~100%</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#DCE7F5', marginTop: 8 }}>中文 Token 税</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', border: '1px solid rgba(220,231,245,0.15)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 22px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 6 }}>Token 是什么</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>模型把文本切成「Token」再计算，按 Token 计费——它是 AI 世界的度量与计价单位。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', border: '1px solid rgba(220,231,245,0.15)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 22px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 6 }}>中文为什么更贵</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>同样语义，中文常被切成更多 Token（1 汉字 ≈ 1-2 Token），比英文多 40%~100%。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.12)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,159,28,0.3)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 22px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 6 }}>省钱冷知识</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>能精简就别啰嗦：Prompt 越干练，Token 越省，账单越好看。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA4B8' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 1 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA4B8' }}>05 / 11</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
